  abilityDesc: 24 combo massive Thunder attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), considerably boosts OD gauge, enormously boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns,
    100% damage reduction for 3 turns, probability of raising allies from KO & damage
    taken enormously restores HP for 3 turns
